# config.  images/v10's own /etc/ttys is these nine lines, and the two things
# it does differently are both load-bearing:
#
#   The console is getty table '2', not '4'.  getty.c:73-77 labels '4'
#   "Console Decwriter" and gives it B300/B300 with CBREAK; '2' at
#   getty.c:55-59 is 9600 with RAW then XTABS+ECHO+CRMOD.
#
#   It stops at tty07.  mkdev makes eight DZ lines, and init.c:251 drops any
#   ttys entry whose /dev node fails access(), so listing tty08..tty31 and
#   sixty-four stream pipes adds nothing.
